demli-audio-capture.exe is Demli's own build, from
apps/desktop/native/process-audio/src/main.cpp, which is adapted from
Microsoft's ApplicationLoopback sample in Windows-classic-samples. That sample
is MIT-licensed, and MIT requires its copyright notice to travel with every
copy, so it is reproduced below and ships next to the binary in every Demli
installer.

Until M16 (2026-10) this directory held prebuilt executables from the
application-loopback npm package by Matin Tat (MIT). Those binaries are no
longer shipped; their notice is kept in the git history of this file.

